        "product_summary": "Broad strap profile: A continuous upper band crosses the foot, with two narrow raised accents forming the simple slide design.\n\nOpen toe and heel: The unfastened rear entry and exposed forefoot create a flat casual slipper outline.\n\nTextured footbed: Fine surface texture is visible in the original Black forefoot close-up.\n\nPatterned outsole sections: The actual underside detail shows grooves and repeated angular panels.\n\nTwo colour options: White and Black are offered in paired EU36-37,38-39,40-41,42-43 and44-45 sizes.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
